# Build context for container/Dockerfile (docker buildx build -f container/Dockerfile .). Allow-list: only what
# the wheel build and the Dockerfile's bind mounts read. The smoke test runs from a bind-mounted checkout, so the
# reference project, tests and docs never need to be in the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!container/requirements/

# Never in the context even under an allowed path: caches, run state, Terraform working files, build output.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
.venv
.codeorca
**/.codeorca
examples/reference/specs
examples/reference/.codeorca
**/.terraform*
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
dist
build
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
